+/// The coherent permission belongs to the private ordinary caller, never a
+/// public/root/Q placement guess. One king each closes king indexing. The
+/// generator excludes king victims, including on an attacked opposite king;
+/// opposite-king safety is not a precondition of its read-only projection.
+/// Within coherent geometry, all source squares/tag planes are valid. Generated
+/// targets come from checked offsets/rays; EP validates its behind offset before
+/// projection; castle squares are fixed home-rank squares. The sole double-step
+/// unwrap is protected by the initial pawn rank. Checker emission stops at two.
+/// generate_legal uses LIMIT=MOVE_CAPACITY and returns after each reaching push
+/// (including each promotion), so no later push can observe a full list.
+/// Prefix reordering stays within that existing length. No remaining valid
+/// unsupported domain was found; this argument does not rely on catching an
+/// aborting production panic or silently replacing worker failure with a skip.
+fn inventory_domain(position: &Position) -> bool {
+    position.counts[Color::White.index()][PieceKind::King.index()] == 1
+        && position.counts[Color::Black.index()][PieceKind::King.index()] == 1
